        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are delighted to present this wonderful five-bedroom family home to the market, ideally situated in the peaceful countryside of Demailestown, Wilkinstown, just a 10-minute drive from Navan town. Extending to approximately 233 sq.m. internally and standing on a generous site of approximately one acre, this impressive property offers spacious accommodation, a tranquil rural setting and a home that has been lovingly cared for by its current owners. The property is presented in great condition throughout, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a comfortable family home with plenty of space both inside and out.\n\nA particularly attractive feature is the sunroom, providing a bright and peaceful retreat to relax and unwind in the evenings while enjoying views of the surrounding gardens. The large rear garden is another major highlight, offering excellent space for outdoor entertaining, family gatherings and recreational activities, with plenty of room for children to play and enjoy the outdoors. A huge boost to the privacy of the property is also the electric gates located to the to the front of the home.\n\nThe property also benefits from a separate, self-contained apartment extending to approximately 47 sq.m., offering a variety of potential uses, including accommodation for extended family, a private guest space or an opportunity to generate additional income, subject to the necessary permissions.\n\nDespite its quiet countryside location, the property enjoys convenient access to a range of local amenities, with Wilkinstown and the surrounding villages providing access to everyday services, while the larger selection of shops, schools, restaurants, sporting facilities and other amenities in Navan are just a short drive away. Outdoor enthusiasts will also appreciate the nearby Boyne Valley to Lakelands Greenway, which connects Navan with Kingscourt and provides a scenic route for walking and cycling through the surrounding countryside. Park Beo Greenway Hub in Wilkinstown further enhances the area's recreational appeal, offering access to the Greenway and facilities for visitors.\n\nWith its generous accommodation, beautifully maintained interiors, substantial gardens and versatile additional apartment, this property presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in a peaceful rural setting while remaining within easy reach of Navan and its amenities."
      },
